ings — keyword trends, top sellers, hidden gems.",trendingTitle:"Trending Keywords — YTrends",trendingDescription:"Discover trending Etsy keywords with strong recent sales and views activity.",keywordTitle:"{keyword} — YTrends",keywordDescription:'Detailed stats, top listings, and related keywords for "{keyword}" on Etsy.',statsTitle:"Market Pulse — YTrends",statsDescription:"Analyzed dataset overview: listings, sellers, pricing, activity, and top categories.",insightsTitle:"Insights — YTrends",insightsDescription:"Advanced analytics: hidden gems, hot listings, keyword alerts, and market movers.",hiddenGemsTitle:"Hidden Gems — YTrends",hiddenGemsDescription:"Discover underserved Etsy niches with high conversion and low competition.",hotListingsTitle:"Hot Listings — YTrends",hotListingsDescription:"Find breakout Etsy listings outperforming their niche in sales and conversions.",categoriesTitle:"Categories — YTrends",categoriesDescription:"Browse Etsy categories, analyze performance, and find opportunities.",categoryStatsTitle:"Category Performance — YTrends",categoryStatsDescription:"Analyze category performance metrics, competition levels, and opportunity scores.",browseTitle:"Browse Listings — YTrends",browseDescription:"Explore all active Etsy listings with search, filters, and sorting.",calendarTitle:"Seller Calendar — YTrends",calendarDescription:"Plan your Etsy shop with seasonal events, prep timelines, and snapshot keyword data.",spyTitle:"Spy — YTrends",spyDescription:"Learn from top-performing Etsy listings. Discover what makes them sell.",methodologyTitle:"Methodology — YTrends",methodologyDescription:"How YTrends indexes Etsy, what snapshot freshness means, and how to read the numbers.",rankingsTopTitle:"Top Rankings — YTrends",rankingsTopDescription:"Top-ranked Etsy keywords by global rank, with optional tier filter.",rankingsMoversTitle:"Rank Movers — YTrends",rankingsMoversDescription:"Biggest 1-day, 7-day, and 30-day rank movers up and down on Etsy.",r