ory","Standard activity levels — research further before entering":"standardActivityLevels","High opportunity category — strong conversion with low competition":"highOpportunityCategory","Promising category — create quality listings and test market response":"promisingCategory","Competitive but valuable — need unique positioning and strong SEO":"competitiveButValuable","Saturated category — consider sub-categories or adjacent niches":"saturatedCategory","Moderate potential — dig deeper into sub-categories for specific opportunities":"moderatePotentialCategory","Currency not supported for USD conversion — prices may be inaccurate":"currencyNotSupported","Significant market share — consider localizing listings for this currency":"significantMarketShare","Moderate presence — monitor for growth opportunities":"moderatePresence","Small market — focus efforts on larger currency markets first":"smallMarket","Rising gem with high score — first-mover advantage, list products now":"risingGemHighScore","Rising gem — research products and prepare listings":"risingGem","Stable niche with proven demand — enter with quality products":"stableNicheProvenDemand","Stable niche — test with a few listings to validate":"stableNiche","Fading but still scoring well — watch for trend reversal":"fadingStillScoring","Declining interest — check back periodically":"decliningInterest","New listing success — analyze title, tags, photos, and pricing strategy for quick wins":"newListingSuccess","High conversion — examine listing photos, description, pricing, and reviews":"highConversion","High volume seller — analyze their SEO, pricing, and product positioning":"highVolumeSeller","Strong performer — review their complete listing strategy":"strongPerformer","High opportunity with low competition — list products immediately":"highOpportunityLowCompetition","Good potential with manageable competition — create optimized listings":"goodPotentialManageable","Moderate opportunity — test with a few listing